# Reserva Salvaje, area 2 (C5b, contract 48), 28 x 22. column = i, row = j. Area 1's north edge arrives at the SOUTH edge (spawn `south` (13,20); the south edge (12..14,21) leads back); the EAST edge (27,10..11) leads to
# area 3; the REST HOUSE (a cottage, door (6,5) -> casa_descanso_1) stands in the north-west. The signature of this area: a big POND in the middle (the Reserva's best fishing: the alloy rod's Reefling at 15 %).
@map reserva_2
@size 28 22
@interior no
@area reserva
@bg 0
@fill sav
@spawn south 13 20 N
@spawn east 26 10 W
@spawn rest_door 6 6 S
@encounters grass rate=30
  quillix 23 26 10   # C9 (contract 56): weight lowered to make room for the fill-in (the table still adds up to 100)
  lanternmoth 24 27 5   # C9 (contract 56): weight lowered to make room for the fill-in (the table still adds up to 100)
  shellfern 23 26 15
  wombamma 26 29 15
  gnucharge 25 28 15
  razorfly 26 28 15
  lambalm 23 25 5
  quillara 23 26 5   # contract 58: the pair of the Quillix line
  mossbud 23 26 5
  dashkip 23 26 10   # C9 (contract 56): the fill-in of the design notes
@end
# Open ground (contract 63, wild zone): a step onto plain ground (not tall grass, water, a door, a ledge, an arrow floor) rolls this table when rand8 < 8 (8/256 per step).
@open_rate 8
# Roaming wild creatures (contract 55, rollout in 63): 3 creatures of this table wander the open ground (not the tall grass); touching one starts that wild battle.
@roam 3 table=grass period=1800
@encounters water rate=15
  lazatee 24 28 40
  skipgoby 24 28 30
  flopfin 22 26 20
  clubrimp 24 27 10
@end
@encounters fish_old
  flopfin 5 5 100
@end
@encounters fish_good rate=128
  flopfin 10 10 25
  skipgoby 10 10 30
  lazatee 10 10 25
  clubrimp 10 10 20
@end
@encounters fish_super
  lazatee 15 20 25
  skipgoby 15 20 25
  clubrimp 15 20 15
  reefling 15 20 15
  flopfin 15 20 20
@end
@legend
  .  tile=sav
  g  tile=dgrass
  a  tile=sav object=acacia_0
  b  tile=sav object=acacia_1
  f  tile=sav object=rfence_i
  F  tile=sav object=rfence_j
  W  tile=canal_o
  T  tile=canal_tr
  r  tile=sav object=rock
  y  tile=sav object=dry_bush
  n  tile=sav
  e  tile=sav
  h  object=cottage
  d  door=cottage
  s  tile=sav object=sign text=rv.sign2 interact=look
  i  item=prime_salve
  j  item=limb_balm
  H  tile=sav hidden=trozo_oro   # hidden (contract 80, hidden items)
@grid
  ffffffffffffffffffffffffffff
  F...................r......F
  F.......................a..F
  F.r......a.........ggggggg.F
  F....hh.....a..b...ggggggg.F
  F....hd............gggggggbF
  F.........TTTTTTTT.ggggggg.F
  F.gggg....WWWWWWWW.ggggggg.F
  F.gggg....WWWWWWWW......i..F
  F.gggg....WWWWWWWW.........F
  F.........WWWWWWWW...a.....e
  F......y..WWWWWWWW....b....e
  Fb.gggggg.....b............F
  F..gggggg.........a........F
  F..gggggb...ggggg..gggggg..F
  F..jggggg...ggggg..ggggyg..F
  F..gggggg...ggggg..gggggg..F
  FH.gggggg...ggggg..gggggg.aF
  F.............s....gggggg..F
